sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户浏览器
    participant A as auth蓝图
    participant DB as SQLAlchemy/DB
    participant D as 被保护蓝图
    participant P as permissions.py
    participant M as menu.py/context_processor
    participant T as base.html(Jinja2)
    Note over U,T: 流程① 登录+权限校验+菜单渲染
    U->>A: POST /auth/login
    A->>DB: User.query.filter_by(username)
    DB-->>A: user
    A->>A: check_password_hash
    A->>A: login_user(user)
    A-->>U: 302 → /
    U->>D: GET /hr/employees
    D->>P: @permission_required('hr.view')
    alt superadmin
        P-->>D: 放行
    else 普通用户
        P->>DB: user_roles→role_permissions→permission.code
        DB-->>P: 权限码集合
        alt 含 'hr.view'
            P-->>D: 放行
        else 不含
            P-->>U: 403.html
        end
    end
    D->>DB: 查询员工列表
    DB-->>D: rows
    D->>M: context_processor 注入 current_menu
    M->>P: MENU_REGISTRY 按权限过滤
    M-->>D: 菜单树
    D->>T: render_template
    T-->>U: 页面(侧边栏+未读角标JS)

    Note over U,DB: 流程② 出入库单据提交→库存更新
    participant W as warehouse蓝图
    participant F as DocForm(Flask-WTF)
    participant S as inventory_service
    U->>W: POST /warehouse/docs/new
    W->>F: validate_on_submit+CSRF
    F-->>W: 通过
    W->>S: apply_stock_document()
    S->>DB: BEGIN
    S->>DB: SELECT Inventory WITH FOR UPDATE
    alt 出库且库存不足
        S->>DB: ROLLBACK
        W-->>U: flash 库存不足
    else 通过
        S->>DB: UPDATE Inventory ± qty
        S->>DB: INSERT StockDocument
        S->>DB: COMMIT
        W-->>U: 302 → /warehouse/inventory

        Note over U,DB: 流程③ 聊天发送+轮询
        participant C as chat蓝图
        U->>C: POST /chat/send
        C->>DB: INSERT ChatMessage(is_read=False)
        C-->>U: 302 回聊天窗
        loop 每13秒
            U->>C: GET /chat/api/unread
            C->>DB: count(receiver=me, is_read=False)
            C-->>U: {count, items[]}
        end
        U->>C: GET /chat/?peer_id=x
        C->>DB: 标记 is_read=True
        C-->>U: 渲染历史+last_id
        loop 会话打开期间每5秒
            U->>C: GET /chat/api/messages?peer_id&after_id
            C->>DB: SELECT id>last_id
            C-->>U: 新消息JSON
        end
    end
